  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis is a magenta-toned recipe that gives the impression images were captured on expired film. I wanted images to portray scenes in a faded, yet memorable way. Contrast is low, shadows are brightened, and brightness is generally subdued. I intended images to be darker, but brightness can be adjusted to suit individual preferences.\nResulting images look more natural than one might expect, so this recipe is effective for creating an unusual ambience and enhancing skin tones in portraits.",
